{
  "info": {
    "name": "AgroControl API - APF2 (JPA + JPQL + Spring Security + JWT)",
    "description": "Coleccion de pruebas de AgroControl (Unidad 2 - Desarrollo Web Integrado - UTP).\n\nUSO: 1) Ejecutar primero 'Auth > Login ADMIN' (guarda el token en la variable {{token}}). 2) El resto de requests envian automaticamente 'Authorization: Bearer {{token}}'. Usuarios de prueba: admin/admin123 (ADMIN), user/user123 (USER), guest/guest123 (GUEST).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenAdmin",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenUser",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenGuest",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Home / Health check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "0. Autenticacion (JWT)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login ADMIN",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login correcto (200) y token recibido', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const t = pm.response.json().token;",
                  "  pm.expect(t).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenAdmin', t);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login USER",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"user\",\n  \"password\": \"user123\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login correcto (200) y token recibido', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const t = pm.response.json().token;",
                  "  pm.expect(t).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenUser', t);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login GUEST",
